{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41514","headline":"赠泉陵上人 · 廖匡图","name":"赠泉陵上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂把枯藤倚碧根，禅堂初创楚江濆。\n直疑松小难留鹤，未信山低住得云。\n草接寺桥牛笛近，日衔村树鸟行分。\n每来共忆曾游处，万壑泉声绝顶闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"廖匡图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}